          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "رسیدگی کردن (residegi kardan) — \"to look into, to deal with (a problem)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مدیر قول داد به مشکل ما رسیدگی کند. Modir qol dâd be moshkel-e mâ residegi konad. The manager promised to look into our problem."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "residegi 'attention, follow-up', from residan. The matter takes be: be in kâr residegi mikonim."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "residegi kardan is built from residegi 'attending to', formed on residan 'to arrive, to reach', usually traced to Middle Persian rasīdan, and kardan 'to do'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
