              "text": "ایراد گرفتن (irâd gereftan) — \"to find fault, to pick holes\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او از همه چیز هتل ایراد میگرفت. U az hame chiz-e hotel irâd migereft. He found fault with everything about the hotel."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "irâd 'objection, fault' + gereftan. The thing criticized takes az."
            }
          ]
        },
